_:ne450e0723a6d46d09359bcb69e21353cb6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Every rml:InclusionAnnotation (or rml:ForeignKeyAnnotation) targeting this view via rml:targetView must also specify exactly one rml:targetFields property.\n        " .
_:n5c1eb90c43ce42848780fda14ad054eeb12 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        At most one of rml:return or rml:returnMap is allowed.\n        " .
