<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A logical view (rml:LogicalView) is a type of abstract logical source that is derived from another abstract logical source by defining fields with data from said abstract logical source.\n    " .
_:n0b9bacd63376491197371c0e4ade89afb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/fieldName> .
_:n04a8923951c74674b651a6480b0ae9bcb1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The source (rml:source) locates the input data source. It is a URI\n        that represents the data source where the data source is.\n        " .
