<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTargetShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A target describes access to a data target. Any data access description\n    is allowed, but rml:Target provides additional properties to complete\n    such descriptions.\n    " .
_:n53881201e02a40f5a8883756a726f029b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n            Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is\n            allowed.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#targetObjectsOf> <http://w3id.org/rml/parentTriplesMap> .
