_:n729c8d4a5fbd4fbab6d9b1dd02aee00ab2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:root defines the root against which a relative rml:path is\n        resolved: rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory, rml:MappingDirectory, or an\n        absolute path string Literal. Defaults to\n        rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory if not specified.\n        " .
_:n19ae0e44757b4175b2119b0c7b7b5139b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:objectMap must be an IRI or blank node and be provided once.\n        " .
