_:n94153629a28d403082988c476d9ac77ab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        property targetFields specifies the Fields target of the InclusionAnnotation.\r\n        " .
_:n98649fa198ff4b969bef880850262499b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLJoinShape> .
_:n584ca2d6cd874d3f80ca0ffb25192f97b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Exactly one rml:logicalSource is required to access the data source.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Node must have a valid rml:LogicalView description.\n    rml:LogicalView requires\n    - exactly one rml:viewOn property, with a rml:AbstractLogicalSource as its value.\n    - at least one rml:field property, with a rml:Field as its value.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StructuralAnnotation" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A source describes access to a data source. Any data access description\n    is allowed, but rml:Source provides additional properties to complete\n    such descriptions.\n    " .
_:ne450e0723a6d46d09359bcb69e21353cb23 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:ne450e0723a6d46d09359bcb69e21353cb24 .
_:n2298b17df0b64859896f79bbd7fc6452b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The target (rml:target) locates the output target. It is a URI\n        that represents the target where it must export generated RDF triples\n        to.\n        " .
_:ne450e0723a6d46d09359bcb69e21353cb20 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#disjoint> <http://w3id.org/rml/viewOn> .
_:n1c7dc062e3ec456aa040f580ad766372b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/UnsafeURI> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:GraphMap must specify an rml:template, rml:reference or rml:constant\n    with the IRI of the Named Graph.\n    " .
_:n0f517ff76e8944a980acba1391091dffb4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/datatypeMap> .
_:ne450e0723a6d46d09359bcb69e21353cb21 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#zeroOrMorePath> _:ne450e0723a6d46d09359bcb69e21353cb22 .
_:ne86898ce7e844036af1536ad1a0184bfb12 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the child of the object component for joining.\n        " .
_:ne450e0723a6d46d09359bcb69e21353cb6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        Inclusion (and ForeignKey) annotations targeting this logical view\n        via rml:targetView. Reached via the inverse of rml:targetView, not\n        rml:structuralAnnotation -- an InclusionAnnotation is the SUBJECT\n        of rml:targetView, not this view's own value, so it isn't\n        otherwise reachable from here; without this property it would\n        never get checked at all.\n        " .
_:n0b9bacd63376491197371c0e4ade89afb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
